error[bad-literal] 1:18-1:22
  (retry {:delays [1.5s 10sec 3days]} (call x.y {}))
                   ^^^^
  This is not a duration literal.
  Durations are a whole number followed by ms, s, m, or h, for example 250ms or 5s.
  Fix: 1500ms

